let __v_1528 = Value::from("Open a Lifetime ISA and put a monthly standing order into it: that adds 25% on up to £4,000 a year. Keep your credit file clean and find out what you could borrow, about four and a half times your income, so the deposit is all that is left to save: 10% of a £200,000 flat is £20,000, or £333 a month for five years.");
